S0 = before 文件中 p 落在目标区间的 uid 集合
St = after 文件中 p 落在目标区间的 uid 集合
统计这些指标：

text


retention_ratio = |S0 ∩ St| / |S0|
outflow_count   = |S0 - St|
inflow_count    = |St - S0|
jaccard_overlap = |S0 ∩ St| / |S0 ∪ St|
还会输出：

text


before_target_count
after_target_count
retained_count
outflow_count
inflow_count
union_count
outflow_ratio_of_before_target
inflow_ratio_of_after_target
jaccard_overlap
命令行样例：

bash

BEFORE="outputs/merge_final/gsm8k_p_scores_final_no_truncation_2.jsonl" \
AFTER="outputs/merge_final/gsm8k_p_scores_final_no_truncation_2_checkpoint-50.jsonl" \
P_RANGE="0.4375,0.59375" \
OUTPUT_PREFIX="outputs/observe/p_pool_stability/p_pool_stability_ckpt0_vs_ckpt50_0.4375_to_0.59375" \
bash run_analyze_p_pool_stability.sh
默认区间是左闭右开：

text


[0.375, 0.65625)
如果你要包含右端点，加：

bash

P_RANGE_RIGHT_CLOSED=1
如果要额外保存 retained / inflow / outflow 的 uid 列表，加：

